  fkBlock: "ENGINE RESULT: a FOREIGN KEY error rolled back the entire SQL batch. The error alone does not establish which relationship or row caused it. Use the original request, actual schema after rollback and any engine diagnosis observed on a private copy. If the same request can be repaired, return its complete SQL in one sql block; do not bypass the error through unrequested deletion, reparenting, NULL links or constraint changes. Otherwise explain only an established obstacle; do not infer a definite cause from missing information.",
  fkStillBlocked: "The foreign-key error could not be resolved; the attempted batch was rolled back. Review the current relationships together with the original request.",
