  pPractice: "Prepare 3 EXERCISES using this schema with window functions (PARTITION BY, ROW_NUMBER), JOIN and GROUP BY. Each exercise: 1-sentence question + answer. Give ALL answer queries in a single ```sql block (separated by ;). Use only this schema's tables.",
